WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.375
Collapse? There is no collapse!

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:08.250
We can make this work!

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.875
Just shoot us an opening, Ben.

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:12.958
-I...I...can't.

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:17.958
-I figured this moment would come.

00:00:17.958 --> 00:00:19.666
-You figured this moment would come?!

00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:20.541
You brought me here!

00:00:20.916 --> 00:00:23.125
-I did what I was supposed to do.

00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:24.000
-Kyrie, no!

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:26.750
Don’t leave me with these scrubs!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.625
-Luckily, you were able to join this superteam, right?

00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:32.708
-So is this like, ya'll's downtown or...?

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:35.041
-No, this is the Nash Path.

00:00:35.041 --> 00:00:36.958
The quickest way to the tournament.

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:39.291
And where I can finally beat...him.

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:41.750
-That’s them, all right.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.375
Luka’s carrying all the weight.

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:44.625
Attack!

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:45.500
-Look out!

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.916
-Oh, phew. It's just the Suns.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.375
Thought it was refs.

00:00:51.375 --> 00:00:52.000
Thank you.

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:53.750
-Wait...

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:56.541
It’s Kyrie.

00:00:57.166 --> 00:00:59.708
And he’s actually planning on participating!

00:00:59.708 --> 00:01:02.416
♪♪♪ Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:01:02.416 --> 00:01:05.833
♪♪♪ Riaru-sa misetayo ♪♪♪

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:08.708
♪♪♪ Born to be a legend ♪♪♪

00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:12.083
♪♪♪ Hikari o mezashite ♪♪♪

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:18.875
♪♪♪ Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:22.666
-Kevin, you must relax.

00:01:22.666 --> 00:01:25.125
-Relax?! There is no relax, champ.

00:01:25.125 --> 00:01:26.458
I’m on 10!

00:01:28.916 --> 00:01:30.708
-OK, what's the game plan?

00:01:30.708 --> 00:01:32.500
-Look, I'm not the savior here.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.791
I’m watching just like everyone else.

00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:39.458
-Good thing it's just my sons.

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:40.708
Hello, Book!

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:42.208
It’s Daddy Luka!

00:01:44.583 --> 00:01:46.875
-Totally legitimate Warriors rings: GO!
[Rings flash]

00:01:46.875 --> 00:01:49.458
[Water crashes]

00:01:49.458 --> 00:01:53.625
[Energy balls blast]

00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:56.250
-Hey! Y'all are shooting more than me.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:57.791
-[sigh] Deandre...

00:01:57.791 --> 00:02:00.291
-Not fair! I don’t wanna be here! Hmph!

00:02:01.833 --> 00:02:04.250
-Looks like the odds are...even.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.291
-Ugh! You and your numbers!

00:02:06.291 --> 00:02:08.083
-Too hot...
[Energy ball whirrs]

00:02:08.083 --> 00:02:08.875
TO HANDLES!

00:02:08.875 --> 00:02:09.375
[Energy ball explodes]

00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:09.958
[Energy ball explodes]
-Ooh!

00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:11.541
-Illegal powerball.

00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:13.041
He took three steps!

00:02:13.041 --> 00:02:14.125
Doesn’t count!
[Voice echoes]

00:02:14.125 --> 00:02:16.666
[Record rewinding]

00:02:16.666 --> 00:02:18.416
-Man...snitch.

00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:19.916
-Well, I’ve done my role.

00:02:19.916 --> 00:02:22.375
[Guitar sting]

00:02:24.083 --> 00:02:26.875
-Come on, Russ. I mean, Steph. I mean, Kyrie. I mean, Book.

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.375
-You handle Kevin.

00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:30.291
I’ve got this!

00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:30.916
[Screaming]

00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:32.833
-Isolation Chamber!

00:02:34.458 --> 00:02:35.708
[Punching noises]
-You started it!

00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:37.333
-No! You started it!

00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:38.500
-Ow, my groin!

00:02:40.041 --> 00:02:41.416
-I can’t believe what you said.

00:02:41.416 --> 00:02:43.458
-You’ll have to be more specific.

00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:45.958
-You said you “did what you were supposed to do.”

00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:48.416
Did that include betraying your best friend?

00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:51.333
You don’t have to answer.

00:02:51.333 --> 00:02:52.708
Your silence speaks volumes.

00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:54.083
Easy Money Mid-Range!

00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:54.875
[Energy barrage blasting]

00:02:54.875 --> 00:02:56.250
-Invisible Defender!

00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:02.541
[Both yelling]

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:08.708
[Somber violin]

00:03:08.708 --> 00:03:09.583
-Kyrie, no!

00:03:09.958 --> 00:03:11.625
Don’t leave me with these scrubs!

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.666
-[Yelling] Huh?

00:03:21.666 --> 00:03:22.750
-Don’t you see?

00:03:23.166 --> 00:03:24.208
I saved you.

00:03:24.208 --> 00:03:26.166
I saved you because...

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.958
I may wanna join the Suns next year.

00:03:28.958 --> 00:03:30.250
-No, Kyrie.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:31.375
Not again.

00:03:31.375 --> 00:03:33.208
I mean, well...maybe?

00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:34.333
If you—but, no.

00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:35.000
-Come on.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.500
For some reason the Mavs have been terrible since I got here.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:38.750
-I mean, yeah, but...

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:39.333
-What? Um...

00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:40.291
-[Laughing]

00:03:40.291 --> 00:03:43.125
While they focus on their little rivalry,

00:03:43.125 --> 00:03:47.125
the No. 1 seed can go straight to Playoff Mountain.

00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:01.500
-You know, Book...

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.708
since you have the 4th seed,

00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:03.958
and the Mavs are out...

00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:05.250
I think...

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:07.208
You might be the better player.

00:04:07.208 --> 00:04:08.333
-Really?

00:04:08.333 --> 00:04:09.083
-NO!

00:04:09.083 --> 00:04:12.625
[Laughing]

00:04:12.625 --> 00:04:15.083
Feels good to laugh.

